00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.227
Loretta Pleska, "Does gum
really stay in my system

00:08:10.227 --> 00:08:12.740
"for seven years if I swallow it?"

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.000
I need to know.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:18.030
I must know where did this
urban legend start from?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.510
If somebody can tell me in the comments,

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:20.870
I'm gonna be so grateful for this.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.140
If you swallow gum, accidentally,

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.240
your teacher called on
you, someone yelled,

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.670
it's gonna come out of you with poop,

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:29.540
generally in a day or two.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.570
Do you know how I know
that gum doesn't stay

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.740
in your system for seven
years, and I can prove it?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.270
Because I've done colonoscopies!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.640
I've done capsule endoscopies on patients.

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.650
I've literally given them
a capsule with a camera,

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.610
goes through their digestive
system, guess what?

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.240
No gum, nothing hanging
out there for seven years.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.750
Gum is just basically plastics,

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.190
sometimes it's like resin.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.630
Your body can't digest that.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.470
It can digest the sugars
and stuff around it,

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.270
but it can't digest the actual gum.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.930
So it essentially just makes its way

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.160
through your digestive system.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:59.890
Now it doesn't mean you
should just start swallowing

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.020
a ton of gum, because what can happen,

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.620
and I've seen case reports of this,

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.650
is if you swallow too much gum,

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:08.070
it can form a big ball and
then cause an obstruction.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:10.960
Or, if you swallow gum,

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.470
and then some kind of
weird substances around it

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.366
like a coin, batteries,

00:09:15.366 --> 00:09:17.500
these case reports happen with children,

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.630
the gum can encapsulate the
coin or the battery or whatever

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:23.210
and then cause a blockage as well.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.060
But if you just swallow gum occasionally

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:28.450
it's gonna come out in your
poop, not the end of the world.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.050
Don't worry about it.

